   :evidence ["clojure -M:test: 13 tests / 48 assertions / 0 failures"
              "clojure -M:e2e: real ffmpeg/ffprobe master render, 6 assertions / 0 failures"
              "resource-guard full release: 81 files / 0 warnings"
              "real Chrome Composer/transport/split verification: no console or HTTP errors"
              "repository-wide ADR freshness inventory and strict: 0 problems"]}
  :adr/consequences
  ["The future kami-app-nle and kami-app-daw placeholders from ADR-2607121400 are satisfied initially by one integrated Studio surface rather than two disconnected apps."
   "The pure contract can later be split into a dedicated repository only if a second app consumes it; premature authority duplication is avoided."
